{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And they were delivered.</b> To inform you of the praise of the officers of Israel — how beloved they are to Israel. Before they heard of his death, what does it say? ״עוֹד מְעַט וּסְקָלֻנִי״ (Exodus 17). But once they heard that the death of Moses depended on the vengeance against Midian, they did not want to go until they were delivered against their will (Sifrei)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:21.348689551Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}